    "name": "fx burst",
    "description": "The burst fx primitive: a heart pop with a rose burst and dots, a SALE badge slam with impact lines, and a lavender half burst under a title.",
    "creativeDirection": "Audience: motion designers checking the burst primitive. Direction: one accent per beat on a dark ink ground (#141416), lavender (#9298fb) and rose (#f96f99) shapes, a small uppercase label naming the beat. Each burst fires on the frame its element lands: at the top of the heart's overshoot, on the badge's floor contact (its keyframed y meets the floor as scaleY squashes), and as the title settles. Review: rays clear the element they burst from, the half burst fans only upward, nothing lingers after 0.8 s."
